    "https://d502jbuhuh9wk.cloudfront.net/articles/68e3df54bfa27c5d6b032854/7k4ev8342.png"
  ],
  "status": 200,
  "text": "<div><h3 data-end=\"218\" data-start=\"208\"><img height=\"206\" src=\"https://d502jbuhuh9wk.cloudfront.net/articles/68e3df54bfa27c5d6b032854/7k4ev8342.png\" width=\"670\"><br>\n </h3>\n\n<h3 data-end=\"218\" data-start=\"208\"><strong data-end=\"218\" data-start=\"212\">1.</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"299\" data-start=\"219\">A developer creates the following snippet to draw a live graph using JavaScript:</p>\n\n<pre data-end=\"381\" data-start=\"300\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;canvas id=\"graphCanvas\"&gt; Browser does not support canvas &lt;/canvas&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"418\" data-start=\"382\">What is the purpose of this element?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"578\" data-start=\"420\"><strong data-end=\"432\" data-start=\"420\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"435\" data-start=\"432\">\nA. To create a video player<br data-end=\"465\" data-start=\"462\">\nB. To draw graphics dynamically using JavaScript<br data-end=\"516\" data-start=\"513\">\nC. To embed 3D models directly<br data-end=\"549\" data-start=\"546\">\nD. To display static images</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"599\" data-start=\"580\"><strong data-end=\"591\" data-start=\"580\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"597\" data-start=\"592\">B</strong></p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"604\" data-start=\"601\">\n<h3 data-end=\"616\" data-start=\"606\"><strong data-end=\"616\" data-start=\"610\">2.</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"659\" data-start=\"617\">An audio streaming website adds this code:</p>\n\n<pre data-end=\"741\" data-start=\"660\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;audio controls&gt; &lt;source src=\"song.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"&gt; &lt;/audio&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"808\" data-start=\"742\">What will happen if the browser doesn’t support the <code data-end=\"803\" data-start=\"794\">&lt;audio&gt;</code> tag?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"999\" data-start=\"810\"><strong data-end=\"822\" data-start=\"810\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"825\" data-start=\"822\">\nA. It will show an error message<br data-end=\"860\" data-start=\"857\">\nB. Nothing will appear<br data-end=\"885\" data-start=\"882\">\nC. The text or fallback content inside <code data-end=\"933\" data-start=\"924\">&lt;audio&gt;</code> will display<br data-end=\"949\" data-start=\"946\">\nD. The browser will play the audio automatically</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1020\" data-start=\"1001\"><strong data-end=\"1012\" data-start=\"1001\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"1018\" data-start=\"1013\">C</strong></p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"1025\" data-start=\"1022\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1037\" data-start=\"1027\"><strong data-end=\"1037\" data-start=\"1031\">3.</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"1089\" data-start=\"1038\">A developer embeds a video with the following code:</p>\n\n<pre data-end=\"1182\" data-start=\"1090\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;video width=\"400\" controls&gt; &lt;source src=\"demo.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"&gt; &lt;/video&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1250\" data-start=\"1183\">Which attribute ensures the user can play, pause, or adjust volume?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1317\" data-start=\"1252\"><strong data-end=\"1264\" data-start=\"1252\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"1267\" data-start=\"1264\">\nA. autoplay<br data-end=\"1281\" data-start=\"1278\">\nB. loop<br data-end=\"1291\" data-start=\"1288\">\nC. controls<br data-end=\"1305\" data-start=\"1302\">\nD. preload</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1338\" data-start=\"1319\"><strong data-end=\"1330\" data-start=\"1319\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"1336\" data-start=\"1331\">C</strong></p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"1343\" data-start=\"1340\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1355\" data-start=\"1345\"><strong data-end=\"1355\" data-start=\"1349\">4.</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"1486\" data-start=\"1356\">A web designer wants to draw scalable shapes using XML-based markup rather than JavaScript.<br data-end=\"1450\" data-start=\"1447\">\nWhich HTML5 element should they use?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1560\" data-start=\"1488\"><strong data-end=\"1500\" data-start=\"1488\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"1503\" data-start=\"1500\">\nA. <code data-end=\"1513\" data-start=\"1506\">&lt;svg&gt;</code><br data-end=\"1516\" data-start=\"1513\">\nB. <code data-end=\"1529\" data-start=\"1519\">&lt;canvas&gt;</code><br data-end=\"1532\" data-start=\"1529\">\nC. <code data-end=\"1542\" data-start=\"1535\">&lt;map&gt;</code><br data-end=\"1545\" data-start=\"1542\">\nD. <code data-end=\"1558\" data-start=\"1548\">&lt;object&gt;</code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1581\" data-start=\"1562\"><strong data-end=\"1573\" data-start=\"1562\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"1579\" data-start=\"1574\">A</strong></p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"1586\" data-start=\"1583\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1598\" data-start=\"1588\"><strong data-end=\"1598\" data-start=\"1592\">5.</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"1618\" data-start=\"1599\">A developer writes:</p>\n\n<pre data-end=\"1673\" data-start=\"1619\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;progress value=\"70\" max=\"100\"&gt;&lt;/progress&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1722\" data-start=\"1674\">What does this element represent on the webpage?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1861\" data-start=\"1724\"><strong data-end=\"1736\" data-start=\"1724\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"1739\" data-start=\"1736\">\nA. A loading animation<br data-end=\"1764\" data-start=\"1761\">\nB. A progress bar showing 70% completion<br data-end=\"1807\" data-start=\"1804\">\nC. A percentage label only<br data-end=\"1836\" data-start=\"1833\">\nD. A disabled input box</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"1882\" data-start=\"1863\"><strong data-end=\"1874\" data-start=\"1863\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"1880\" data-start=\"1875\">B</strong></p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"1887\" data-start=\"1884\">\n<h3 data-end=\"1899\" data-start=\"1889\"><strong data-end=\"1899\" data-start=\"1893\">6.</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"1935\" data-start=\"1900\">A website collects user data using:</p>\n\n<pre data-end=\"2121\" data-start=\"1936\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;form oninput=\"result.value=parseInt(a.value)+parseInt(b.value)\"&gt; &lt;input type=\"number\" id=\"a\"&gt; + &lt;input type=\"number\" id=\"b\"&gt; = &lt;output name=\"result\"&gt;&lt;/output&gt; &lt;/form&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2170\" data-start=\"2122\">What is the function of the <code data-end=\"2160\" data-start=\"2150\">&lt;output&gt;</code> tag here?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2317\" data-start=\"2172\"><strong data-end=\"2184\" data-start=\"2172\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"2187\" data-start=\"2184\">\nA. To take input from user<br data-end=\"2216\" data-start=\"2213\">\nB. To display calculated results dynamically<br data-end=\"2263\" data-start=\"2260\">\nC. To submit form data<br data-end=\"2288\" data-start=\"2285\">\nD. To log data into console</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2338\" data-start=\"2319\"><strong data-end=\"2330\" data-start=\"2319\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"2336\" data-start=\"2331\">B</strong></p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"2343\" data-start=\"2340\">\n<h3 data-end=\"2355\" data-start=\"2345\"><strong data-end=\"2355\" data-start=\"2349\">7.</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"2373\" data-start=\"2356\">A developer uses:</p>\n\n<pre data-end=\"2490\" data-start=\"2374\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;details&gt; &lt;summary&gt;Click to read more&lt;/summary&gt; This section contains additional details. &lt;/details&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2546\" data-start=\"2491\">What will happen when the user clicks the summary line?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2707\" data-start=\"2548\"><strong data-end=\"2560\" data-start=\"2548\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"2563\" data-start=\"2560\">\nA. The page will reload<br data-end=\"2589\" data-start=\"2586\">\nB. The hidden text will expand or collapse<br data-end=\"2634\" data-start=\"2631\">\nC. The text will be deleted<br data-end=\"2664\" data-start=\"2661\">\nD. The summary will turn into a hyperlink</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2728\" data-start=\"2709\"><strong data-end=\"2720\" data-start=\"2709\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"2726\" data-start=\"2721\">B</strong></p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"2733\" data-start=\"2730\">\n<h3 data-end=\"2745\" data-start=\"2735\"><strong data-end=\"2745\" data-start=\"2739\">8.</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"2771\" data-start=\"2746\">A web developer includes:</p>\n\n<pre data-end=\"2827\" data-start=\"2772\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;meter value=\"0.8\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\"&gt;&lt;/meter&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2862\" data-start=\"2828\">What does this represent in HTML5?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"2986\" data-start=\"2864\"><strong data-end=\"2876\" data-start=\"2864\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"2879\" data-start=\"2876\">\nA. A circular progress indicator<br data-end=\"2914\" data-start=\"2911\">\nB. A gauge showing 80% value<br data-end=\"2945\" data-start=\"2942\">\nC. A numeric input box<br data-end=\"2970\" data-start=\"2967\">\nD. A bar chart</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"3007\" data-start=\"2988\"><strong data-end=\"2999\" data-start=\"2988\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"3005\" data-start=\"3000\">B</strong></p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"3012\" data-start=\"3009\">\n<h3 data-end=\"3024\" data-start=\"3014\"><strong data-end=\"3024\" data-start=\"3018\">9.</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"3045\" data-start=\"3025\">A news website uses:</p>\n\n<pre data-end=\"3165\" data-start=\"3046\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;article&gt; &lt;header&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Breaking News&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/header&gt; &lt;p&gt;New updates on the current topic...&lt;/p&gt; &lt;/article&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"3218\" data-start=\"3166\">What is the semantic purpose of the <code data-end=\"3213\" data-start=\"3202\">&lt;article&gt;</code> tag?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"3363\" data-start=\"3220\"><strong data-end=\"3232\" data-start=\"3220\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"3235\" data-start=\"3232\">\nA. Defines navigation links<br data-end=\"3265\" data-start=\"3262\">\nB. Marks independent, self-contained content<br data-end=\"3312\" data-start=\"3309\">\nC. Creates a sidebar<br data-end=\"3335\" data-start=\"3332\">\nD. Wraps all page elements</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"3384\" data-start=\"3365\"><strong data-end=\"3376\" data-start=\"3365\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"3382\" data-start=\"3377\">B</strong></p>\n\n<hr data-end=\"3389\" data-start=\"3386\">\n<h3 data-end=\"3402\" data-start=\"3391\"><strong data-end=\"3402\" data-start=\"3395\">10.</strong></h3>\n\n<p data-end=\"3439\" data-start=\"3403\">A developer structures a webpage as:</p>\n\n<pre data-end=\"3538\" data-start=\"3440\"> </pre>\n\n<p><code>&lt;header&gt;Header Section&lt;/header&gt; &lt;main&gt;Main Content&lt;/main&gt; &lt;footer&gt;Footer Info&lt;/footer&gt; </code></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"3579\" data-start=\"3539\">What is the purpose of the <code data-end=\"3574\" data-start=\"3566\">&lt;main&gt;</code> tag?</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"3760\" data-start=\"3581\"><strong data-end=\"3593\" data-start=\"3581\">Options:</strong><br data-end=\"3596\" data-start=\"3593\">\nA. Defines content repeated on every page<br data-end=\"3640\" data-start=\"3637\">\nB. Marks the central and unique content of the document<br data-end=\"3698\" data-start=\"3695\">\nC. Used to hold navigation menus<br data-end=\"3733\" data-start=\"3730\">\nD. Contains only metadata</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"3781\" data-start=\"3762\"><strong data-end=\"3773\" data-start=\"3762\">Answer:</strong> <strong data-end=\"3779\" data-start=\"3774\">B</strong></p>\n</div>"
}